<body>
    <h1>Creating a Date Filter in Power BI</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Thisguideprovidesstep-by-ste=
pinstructionsonhowtocreateadatefilterinPowerBIthatdefaultstolastweek,lastmo=
nth,oranotherspecifieddateperiod.">This guide provides step-by-step instruc=
tions on how to create a date filter in Power BI that defaults to last week=
, last month, or another specified date period.</h2>
<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Step 1: Create a Date Slicer</p>
<ol>
<li>Add a Date Slicer to your Power BI report.</li>
<li>Set the slicer to filter between dates.</li>
<li>Optionally, you can enable the slider to allow for easier date range se=
lection.<br><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embe=
dded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"fal=
se" height=3D"195" src=3D"65887ce9c74feca062441ac987f6f0b3dd34871edfdfdb643=
5f526bf9d569970" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1473086593/image-2=
025-8-4_12-18-17-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754324297810&amp=
;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1=
473086606" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"=
attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8-4_12-18-17-1=
.png" data-base-url=3D"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resource-content-typ=
e=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1473086593" data-linke=
d-resource-container-version=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Step2:CreateaDateTable">Step 2: Crea=
te a Date Table</h3>
<p>Create a new Date Table using DAX to include different types of date per=
iods.</p>
<p>Example DAX code:</p>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"259" src=3D"b6e8e131b2c5054b18e6236d2abcb2b59847504cba5e53d404f8124cef=
d3f2c5" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1473086593/image-2025-8-4_1=
2-19-21.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754324361903&amp;api=3Dv2" =
data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1473086607" =
data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment"=
 data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8-4_12-19-21.png" data-ba=
se-url=3D"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/pn=
g" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1473086593" data-linked-resource-co=
ntainer-version=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
<p>This DAX code creates a table with Date and Type columns, where Type can=
 be "View Last Month" or "Select Custom Date".</p>
<h3 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Step3:CreateTypeSlicer">Step 3: Crea=
te Type Slicer</h3>
<ol>
<li>Add a slicer to your report using the "Type" column from the</li>
</ol>
<p>Dates_Filter</p>
<p>table.</p>
<ol>
<li>Place this slicer next to the date slicer.</li>
</ol>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" heigh=
t=3D"205" src=3D"2ec3d5170e293b9bdfa216737149e7977ff1fc6aad78b4d665d7faf068=
023ee0" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1473086593/image-2025-8-4_1=
2-19-56-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754324396953&amp;api=3Dv2=
" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1473086611=
" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachmen=
t" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8-4_12-19-56-1.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"imag=
e/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1473086593" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-version=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"306"></span></p>
<h3 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Step4:AddActionButtons">Step 4: Add =
Action Buttons</h3>
<ol>
<li>Add a button to your report to clear the slicers.</li>
<li>Click on the "View Last Month" type in the Type slicer and set the date=
 slicer to the corresponding dates.</li>
<li>Create a bookmark named "Last Month Bookmark" with this configuration a=
nd set the button action to this bookmark.</li>
</ol>
<p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manu=
al-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image confluence-thumbnail" drag=
gable=3D"false" height=3D"1025" src=3D"247b94870a8aae64c40e0edf7e1a65775e98=
2dbd945d76e30bc1538e76939bca" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/14730=
86593/image-2025-8-4_12-20-12-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754=
324412977&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-res=
ource-id=3D"1473086612" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-reso=
urce-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8=
-4_12-20-12-1.png" data-base-url=3D"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resourc=
e-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"147308659=
3" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"417"></sp=
an></p>
<h3 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Step5:CreateCustomDateBookmark">Step=
 5: Create Custom Date Bookmark</h3>
<ol>
<li>Click on "Select Custom Dates" in the Type slicer, which should show al=
l dates from your date table.</li>
<li>Create a bookmark named "Custom Dates Bookmark" with this configuration=
.</li>
<li>Add a clear button and set its action to the "Custom Dates Bookmark".<b=
r><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manua=
l-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false" height=
=3D"278" src=3D"46fd608f72ea8ed2a224cea1418f490e11645ae4e0573fbf98934b54ec5=
e3ab1" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1473086593/image-2025-8-4_12=
-20-22-1.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754324422133&amp;api=3Dv2"=
 data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1473086614"=
 data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment=
" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8-4_12-20-22-1.png" data=
-base-url=3D"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image=
/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1473086593" data-linked-resource=
-container-version=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"380"></span></li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"CreatingaDateFilterinPowerBI-Step6:OrganizeLayers">Step 6: Organi=
ze Layers</h3>
<ol>
<li>Ensure that the buttons created are at the top level in the layers in t=
he selection pane for proper function.<br><span class=3D"confluence-embedde=
d-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-em=
bedded-image confluence-thumbnail" draggable=3D"false" height=3D"669" src=
=3D"805b6bc9cebf0e469a9d3dab5888041da666235194f4f86817c8e454bee75141" data-=
image-src=3D"/download/attachments/1473086593/image-2025-8-4_12-20-30-1.png=
?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1754324430510&amp;api=3Dv2" data-unreso=
lved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1473086615" data-linked=
-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linke=
d-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2025-8-4_12-20-30-1.png" data-base-url=3D=
"https://kb.uwm.com" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-l=
inked-resource-container-id=3D"1473086593" data-linked-resource-container-v=
ersion=3D"2" alt=3D"" width=3D"400"></span></li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
